{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日プリンシパルとお仕事と、頑張ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日で5日目、7公演が終了しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだプリンシパルは始まったばかりです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日々色々と考えるし、悩んだりする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か一歩を踏み出してみないと分からないことばかりなので、毎日が冒険です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメディは楽しいです。大好きです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから難しい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭の回転を良くしたいと思う今日この頃。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな自分を見せれるように、千秋楽まで楽しんで頑張りたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は舞台から落ちたりしていないのでご安心を( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/06/05/9408133/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の乃木どこ、生駒ちゃんの総選挙への道。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か力になれてるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人で抱え込んだりしてないかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全員が同じ気持ちでよかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫、生駒ちゃんにはみんながついてるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつだって甘えてきていいんだからね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔でいれるように、私たちも支えるし応援してる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな生駒が大好きだよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/06/05/9408133/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一つ言いたいことがあったんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も真夏の全国ツアーが決まり嬉しい限り！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が！しかし！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何故、誕生日の日は何もないんだ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年もそうだった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣くぞ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しいじゃないの。おこ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shir